# --- 2026-09-08: pre-push hygiene -------------------------------------------
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB. These are append-only collector
# outputs and process logs: regenerable, and their conclusions already live in the
# markdown record. Kept on disk, never pushed.
*.log
.venv/
research/midcap/fresh_snapshots.jsonl
research/midcap/attention.jsonl
research/midcap/*.jsonl
# Data caches: 20k+ regenerable files (memebot tape, flow/gex/opts caches). The 27
# evidence files already tracked under research/data stay tracked -- .gitignore does
# not affect tracked paths -- but nothing new is swept in.
research/data/
# Numeric panel caches: regenerable, and one is 104.9 MB -- over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
*.npz
*.npy
